&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Technology :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shift is the leading AI platform for insurance. Shift combines generative, agentic, and predictive AI to transform underwriting, claims, and fraud and risk - driving operational efficiency, exceptional customer experiences and measurable business impact. Trusted by the world&#39;s leading insurers, Shift delivers AI when and where it matters most, at scale and with proven results.&lt;/p&gt;
